But note that we have multiple reactions on same molecule, which may not be realistic (you can't apply multiple reactions to same intermediate). However the schema may allow multiple reaction children under a molecule (maybe not restricted). The schema says molecules can have children that are either reactions or other molecules. It doesn't restrict number. So okay.

Now we need to verify route. Let's test with verify_route.
